    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo kūshika Halani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yakobo ūja nalo ū lūgendo lwakwe, ūūkashika kū sī ya bana kīya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho alīlola ūko na ūko, ūūbona lwinzī ng'witogolo, na madaale adatū ga ng'holo jalaalaga hihī nalo, nguno ī mitugo jang'wisījiagwa a ha lwinzī lwenūlo. Gwike lyalīho iwe itaale lya kūkundīkīja a higūlya ya lwinzī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A badīīmi bilindīīlaga, a madaale ūlū gikuminga, baaliibūmbaga ī liwe baalīpilingitya kūlyīnja a ha nomo gwa lwinzī, hū bajing'wisha ī ng'holo. Ūlū bamala baalīshosha a ha nomo gwa lwinzī likala līkundīkīgije gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yakobo ūbabūja a badīīmi gīkī, “Bing'we badūgū bane, mulī bana halī?” Būng'wīla, “Tūlī bana Halani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbabūja, “Mukūlīmana ling'wana lī Labani lya kū ng'wa Naholi?” Būhaya, “Tūlīmanile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo ūbabūja, “Līlī mhola?” Būshosha, “Ee līlī mhola, nīyo na nshīke walyo Laheli ūūyo aliza na ng'holo jakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla, “Nibūlī ng'wajitūūjaga ī mutigo, alīyo lītaalī ī līīmi ū kūshika a h'ikanza lya kūtūūja? Jing'wishagi mujitwale jikadīīme.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būnshokeja balīhaya, “Tūtūūdūla tūkalindaga gibilinga pye a madaale, hūna ī liwe lyapilingitiwa kwīnga a ha nomo gwa lwinzī, twajing'wisha ī ng'holo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo na Laheli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ataalī ūyomba nabo, ūshika ū Laheli alī nī ng'holo ja ng'wa ise, nguno hū walī ndīīmi wajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo aho wamona ū Laheli, ū nshīke wa ng'wa mamiye Labani, ū nsīzaye wa nina, nī ng'holo ja ng'wa Labani, ūja a ha lwinzī ūkalīpilingitya ī liwe lyīnga a ha nomo gwa lwinzī, ūjing'wisha ī ng'holo ja ng'wa mamiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yakobo ūmbipa ū Laheli, ūlīla n'ilaka lya higūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wīla ū Laheli gīkī walī ndūgūye kū lwandī lwa ng'wa ise; ng'wana wa ng'wa Lebeka. Na lūūlū ū ng'wanikī ūpeela kūjūng'wīla ū ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Labani aho wajiigwa ī mhola ja ng'wa Yakobo ū ng'witūnja wa ng'wilūmbūye, wihuuta ajile ko kūnsūng'wanha. Ūshikīla kūng'wibuga mu shikuba; ūmbipa, hūna wiza nang'hwe ha kaya. Aho bashika ū Yakobo ūnsomboolela pyī ī mihayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Labani ūng'wīla, “Ū bebe ūlī mīlī gwane na mininga gane gete.” Ū Yakobo akikala nū mamiye ikanza lya ng'weji ngima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo kūtoola ha ng'wa mamiye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Labani ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ū bebe hū wikale ūkūnitūmamīlaga dalali dūhū, shitange īkī ūlī ng'wipwa wane? Niwīlage ī mheela īyo ūtogilwe kwanukūla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, ū Labani walī na bashīke babīlī; ū ntaale witanagwa Leya, ū ndo Laheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Leya walī na miso mooba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:17.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mooba:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, magokolo kūlola.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " alīyo ū Laheli walī nsoga no ī lihanga lyakwe ū kūlola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikū jenījo ū Yakobo akasangwa wantogilwe ū Laheli; na lūūlū ūhaya, “Nakūkūtūmamīla myaka mpungatī kūlwa kūmpandīka ū nshīke wako ū ndo, ū Laheli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Labani ūng'wīla, “Hambū hambū ūnsole",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ūnsole:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nakwinhe bebe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " bebe, kūtinda munhū ūngī; igashaga henaha lūūlū hamò nane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yakobo ūhedekwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kūhedekwa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ngosha kūtūmama milīmo ya ha būkwiye, īyo ītūng'wenhelaga solobo ū wei ū ng'wikanza.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ūtūmama ikanza lya myaka mpungatī kūlwa kūmpandīka ū Laheli. Alīyo īkī walī antogilwe īkashila wangū no, ū kūlī wei yūbiza gītī shikū ngehu dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yakobo ūng'wīla ū Labani gīkī, “Ninhage lūūlū ū nke wane, nguno lyashikaanaga ī likanza; natogilwe natoole.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Labani ūbitana pye a bagosha b'ipandī lyenīlo, ūbeeja shigukulu sha kūlya na kūyega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wila ū būjikū, ūnsola ū nshīke wakwe ū Leya ūng'winha ū kūlī Yakobo; ūlaala nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Labani ūsola nsese wakwe nkīma, witanagwa Zilipa, ūng'winha ū nshīke wakwe gīkī ayūntūmamīla milīmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho weela ī dilū, gashi Leya! Ū Yakobo ūng'wīla ū Labani gīkī, “Wanīītīlaga masala kī a genaya? Tūhaya naakūtūmamīlile myaka mpungatī gīkī nansole Laheli, hama nibūlī ūnilembe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Labani ūshosha alīhaya, “Ū gwa kūtooja nshīke ndo ūnkīlanhya ū ntaale gūtī gwise; tūtajaga chene a bise ū kūūnū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaga nang'hwe nyuma ū ng'wenūyū, ūshikīlīje ūmo shilī ī shīmīle; tūkūkwinha nū ūngī kūlwa būtūmami bo myaka yīngī mpungatī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo wīta ng'hana ūmo akawīlīlwa; wīmala ī nyuma alī nang'hwe ū Leya. Hūna ū Labani ūng'winha nū nshīke wakwe ū Laheli gīkī nang'hwe abize nke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Labani ūsola hangī nsese wakwe nkīma, witanagwa Biliha, ūng'winha ū nshīke wakwe ū Laheli gīkī ayūntūmamīla milīmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo ūntoola nū Laheli, ū ng'wene ūntogwa kūtinda ū Leya. Na lūūlū ūntūmamīla ū Labani myaka yīngī mpungatī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baana ba ng'wa Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA aho wabona gīkī ū Leya ahenilwe, ūnugūlīla būbyīle; alīyo ū Laheli ūbiza ngūmba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Leya ūbūūcha nda, ūbyala ng'wana ngosha, ūng'wilīka ī lina lyakwe Lubeni. Nguno akahaya gīkī, “Ū SEEBA wagabonile a makoye gane. Nalībona lūūlū ī haha ū ngoshi wane akūnitogwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbūūcha nda hangī; aho wabyala ng'wana ūngī ngosha ūhaya, “Īlī kūlwa nguno ū SEEBA wigwile ī gīkī nahenilwe, hī chene waninha nū ng'wenūyū.” Ū ng'wene ūng'winha lina lya Simioni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbūūcha nda yīngī hangī; aho wabyalī nyanda nī hangī ūhaya, “Ī haha lūūlū ū ngoshi wane akūniyegela; nguno nashisha baana bagosha badatū nalīmyalīla.” Ū ng'wene winhwa lina lya Lawī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahayūbūūcha nda yīngī hangī ūbyala ngosha; ūhaya, “Ū lūkangala ūlū nankumīlīje SEEBA.” Na lūūlū ū ng'wene ūng'wilīka Yuda; hūna wīma ū būbyīle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
